{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1128646-the-fanfiction-thread","id":1128646,"title":"The Fanfiction Thread","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-08-13T17:54:19-07:00","id":1128646,"title":"The Fanfiction Thread","content":"So, does anybody here write or read fanfiction? I do as a hobby, and I have to admit it is a fun way to pass the time when I'm bored. I know fanfic gets a lot of flak on the internet because admittedly a good chunk of it is utter crap (Sturgeon's Law and all) but there's some good fics out there. I've recently begun writing fanfiction as a hobby, and I kind of like it. Yeah, I know I should be writing original fiction, and maybe one day I will, but I write mainly just for fun, not to be published.<br /> <br /> If you're doing it just for fun, I don't see what the problem is. So feel free to share fanfics here. It can be fanfics you write yourself, or just fanfics you happen to enjoy. All I ask is that you keep it work-safe.<br /> <br /> Here's a fanfic I literally just began writing this evening and posted the first chapter a few minutes ago. It's a &quot;Story Within A Story&quot; and is WoD related. It's titled &quot;The Basement Chronicles&quot; and is set in the 1990's. It's about a gaming group who discover Vampire: The Masquerade and start playing it, with the story of their characters and chronicle being the story within the story of the gaming group. The framing story is meant to be lighthearted and a little tongue-in-cheek, while the internal chronicle story is played straight like a Vampire chronicle typical of 1e and early 2e. I'm not sure if it's any good or not, but I literally just started writing it so I've got room to improve if I need to make any improvements. Besides, I'm only doing this for fun, not so I can win awards.<br /> <br /> Link to my fic below.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://archiveofourown.org/works/11796279/chapters/26606571\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"http://archiveofourown.org/images/ao3_logos/logo_42.png\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://archiveofourown.org/works/11796279/chapters/26606571\" target=\"_blank\"> Home | Archive of Our Own </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://archiveofourown.org/works/11796279/chapters/26606571\" target=\"_blank\"> http://archiveofourown.org/works/11796279/chapters/26606571 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> An Archive of Our Own, a project of the Organization for Transformative Works </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <br /> Anyone else into fanfics?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1579-camilla","name":"Camilla","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1579_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1044"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-13T18:40:06-07:00","id":1128658,"title":"","content":"I've tried my hand at writing them a couple of times. The most recent one is actually floating around the Mage the Awakening boards. It was an attempt to cross CofD with Harry Potter, and while I really like my ideas for (some of which date back over a decade and a half) I bit off way more than I can chew, so I'm currently reworking it. I actually just started planning another one today, actually, a cross between CofD and Marvel. If I actually get it off the ground, I'll post a link here.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-13T18:43:22-07:00","id":1128660,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Second Chances</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1128646-the-fanfiction-thread?p=1128658#post1128658\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I've tried my hand at writing them a couple of times. The most recent one is actually floating around the Mage the Awakening boards. It was an attempt to cross CofD with Harry Potter, and while I really like my ideas for (some of which date back over a decade and a half) I bit off way more than I can chew, so I'm currently reworking it. I actually just started planning another one today, actually, a cross between CofD and Marvel. If I actually get it off the ground, I'll post a link here.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I look forward to checking it out once it's posted!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1579-camilla","name":"Camilla","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1579_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1044"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-13T19:25:13-07:00","id":1128672,"title":"","content":"I've written a few pieces of fanfiction here and there. I mean I pretty much only write about OCs even when writing in someone else's universe.<br /> <br /> Somewhere long lost is a piece of fanfic I wrote for Vampire first/second edition.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2367-resplendent-fire","name":"Resplendent Fire","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2367_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1887"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-13T19:30:09-07:00","id":1128674,"title":"","content":"I mix and match OC's and canon characters depending on the setting.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1579-camilla","name":"Camilla","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1579_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1044"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-13T19:44:18-07:00","id":1128678,"title":"","content":"I feel like a bad nerd because I never had a fanfiction phase and have never read anything.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-13T19:45:04-07:00","id":1128679,"title":"","content":"I don't think Naruto was around in 1996.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-13T20:44:14-07:00","id":1128693,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Caladriu</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1128646-the-fanfiction-thread?p=1128679#post1128679\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't think Naruto was around in 1996.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> It's &quot;Alternate Universe&quot; where the characters are in another timeline. They're not in the Ninja World of Naruto (which debuted in 1999 in Japan as a manga) but in our world in 1996.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1579-camilla","name":"Camilla","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1579_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1044"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-13T20:45:07-07:00","id":1128695,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1128646-the-fanfiction-thread?p=1128678#post1128678\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I feel like a bad nerd because I never had a fanfiction phase and have never read anything.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Eh, it's alright. Different strokes for different folks. Not everyone's into fanfiction and that is perfectly okay.<br /> <br /> Also, sorry for the double-post.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1579-camilla","name":"Camilla","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1579_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1044"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-13T21:18:11-07:00","id":1128704,"title":"","content":"I am more bothered by people who are aggressively anti-fanfiction than I am by anyone who has never read or written any.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2367-resplendent-fire","name":"Resplendent Fire","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2367_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1887"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-13T23:45:56-07:00","id":1128726,"title":"","content":"I've been writing fanfiction for a while now, personally I prefer to go for epic crossovers that draw in a lot of different characters.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/483-flyboy254","name":"Flyboy254","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar483_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"703"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-14T17:08:45-07:00","id":1129029,"title":"","content":"I think I'm going to work on my fanfic some more, help get my mind off of some stuff that has deeply upset me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1579-camilla","name":"Camilla","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1579_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1044"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-22T20:34:16-07:00","id":1132896,"title":"","content":"Sorry for the double-post, but here is a new fanfic I have started. This one will be updated weekly, and is sort of personal to me. It's inspired by fond childhood memories of growing up in the hills of Southwestern Virginia.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://archiveofourown.org/works/11884056/chapters/26838708\" target=\"_blank\">http://archiveofourown.org/works/118...pters/26838708</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1579-camilla","name":"Camilla","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1579_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1044"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-27T12:13:54-07:00","id":1134549,"title":"","content":"Do you recommend Archive of Our Own over FF.net, or is FF still the place to go?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/483-flyboy254","name":"Flyboy254","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar483_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"703"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-27T16:06:37-07:00","id":1134649,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Flyboy254</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1128646-the-fanfiction-thread?p=1134549#post1134549\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Do you recommend Archive of Our Own over FF.net, or is FF still the place to go?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Both are good, but I mainly use Archive Of Our Own since it's more user-friendly in my book. No need to upload documents and less restrictions as well.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1579-camilla","name":"Camilla","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1579_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1044"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-31T15:51:25-07:00","id":1135976,"title":"","content":"Once again, I apologize for yet another double-post but here's my newest fanfic project, titled &quot;Autumn Moon Nights&quot;. My second fanfic project &quot;Appalachian Backyard LARP&quot; also has a second chapter now!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://archiveofourown.org/works/11961429/chapters/27047316\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://archiveofourown.org/works/11961429/chapters/27047316\" target=\"_blank\"> Home | Archive of Our Own </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://archiveofourown.org/works/11961429/chapters/27047316\" target=\"_blank\"> http://archiveofourown.org/works/11961429/chapters/27047316 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> An Archive of Our Own, a project of the Organization for Transformative Works </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1579-camilla","name":"Camilla","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1579_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1044"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-24T14:11:00-07:00","id":1143582,"title":"","content":"I like to read and write fanfiction. I even have a crossover that uses Garou. Though it doesn't use all aspects of Werewolf: the Apocalypse because it is a crossover with Buffy: tVS and has Xander go through a first change and become a Garou. The world is more like it is in Buffy, then the pre-apocalyptic world of Werewolf: tA. Though Buffy has it fair share of small to world ending apocalypses. <br /> <br /> \u200bIf you want to check it out, it's on AO3, under the username TwistedImage and it is ch. 4 of a one-shot collection named Throw a Penny in the Wishing Well. I only have the beginning up and it was the very first draft of the story, so a good bit has been changed since then. Mostly to do with the Umbra and interaction with Elder Garou. <br /> <br /> \u200bI actually have some questions that maybe someone more familiar with the game could answer. I've tried to read as much as I can online but I didn't buy the books, since I was only doing research for the crossover. Which has spiraled out of control.<br /> <br /> \u200b1-Do Garou look different in the Penumbra/Umbra? I read somewhere that older souls (ones that have been reborn many times) that have done great or terrible deeds can have a reflection of that in the Umbra. Though I can't find where I read that and it may have been a person's own design, instead of canon to the games. <br /> <br /> \u200b2-What would the Sunnydale Hellmouth be? So far, I've just kept it as a portal into a hell dimension but the hell mouth monsters that come out of it will be 'wyrm' creatures, especially that multi-headed one that happens during mid-season 3 of Buffy. I'm trying to mix the lore a little from each. <br /> <br /> \u200b3-Some ideas on how to work banes, formori, and even BSDs, along with demons and Sunnydale vampires would be great. <br /> <br /> \u200bI might have a few more but those are the top three. <br /> <br /> \u200bAlso, Camilla I tried to find your fanfics or use the links but they aren't working. What is your AO3 username?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/17550-twistedimage","name":"TwistedImage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar17550_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-24T15:11:02-07:00","id":1143604,"title":"","content":"Ah, the chronic fanfic writer's dilemma. Coming up with ideas is way easier than writing them out. Current list:<br /> <br /> - Mage the Awakening Harry Potter<br /> - Werewolf the Forsaken Harry Potter<br /> - Planescape Harry Potter-like novel in Sigil<br /> - Planescape Romance Novel set in the City of Brass<br /> - Planescape Vilianous Romance Novel with Drow in Baator set in the City of Dis<br /> - Eberron Romance Novel with House Vadalis on the Talenta Plains. <br /> - Marvel/CofD Crossover Universe<br /> - DC/CofD Crossover Universe<br /> <br /> I need a time machine so I can write and work!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-25T12:23:24-07:00","id":1143865,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TwistedImage</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1128646-the-fanfiction-thread?p=1143582#post1143582\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I like to read and write fanfiction. I even have a crossover that uses Garou. Though it doesn't use all aspects of Werewolf: the Apocalypse because it is a crossover with Buffy: tVS and has Xander go through a first change and become a Garou. The world is more like it is in Buffy, then the pre-apocalyptic world of Werewolf: tA. Though Buffy has it fair share of small to world ending apocalypses.<br /> <br /> \u200bIf you want to check it out, it's on AO3, under the username TwistedImage and it is ch. 4 of a one-shot collection named Throw a Penny in the Wishing Well. I only have the beginning up and it was the very first draft of the story, so a good bit has been changed since then. Mostly to do with the Umbra and interaction with Elder Garou.<br /> <br /> \u200bI actually have some questions that maybe someone more familiar with the game could answer. I've tried to read as much as I can online but I didn't buy the books, since I was only doing research for the crossover. Which has spiraled out of control.<br /> <br /> \u200b1-Do Garou look different in the Penumbra/Umbra? I read somewhere that older souls (ones that have been reborn many times) that have done great or terrible deeds can have a reflection of that in the Umbra. Though I can't find where I read that and it may have been a person's own design, instead of canon to the games.<br /> <br /> \u200b2-What would the Sunnydale Hellmouth be? So far, I've just kept it as a portal into a hell dimension but the hell mouth monsters that come out of it will be 'wyrm' creatures, especially that multi-headed one that happens during mid-season 3 of Buffy. I'm trying to mix the lore a little from each.<br /> <br /> \u200b3-Some ideas on how to work banes, formori, and even BSDs, along with demons and Sunnydale vampires would be great.<br /> <br /> \u200bI might have a few more but those are the top three.<br /> <br /> \u200bAlso, Camilla I tried to find your fanfics or use the links but they aren't working. What is your AO3 username?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> My username is Storyteller93 and I deleted all my fanfics. I'm going to be doing a reboot of some old fanfics as well as some new ones, so I felt like deleting my old fics that are going nowhere.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1579-camilla","name":"Camilla","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1579_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1044"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-25T15:55:58-07:00","id":1143915,"title":"","content":"I've tried writing fan-fiction a few times when I've gotten a creative itch, but I usually go back, re-read what I wrote, cringe and delete it before it gets to be longer than five or six pages.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-27T17:35:51-07:00","id":1144570,"title":"","content":"My problem is that I have a ton started but few finished. My muse likes to jump around a bit much.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/17550-twistedimage","name":"TwistedImage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar17550_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T07:11:54-08:00","id":1158931,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Camilla</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1128646-the-fanfiction-thread#post1128646\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So, does anybody here write or read fanfiction?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I used to write as a hobby, but ran into what I initially thought was a bought of writer's block that persisted for 5 years... then 10 years... and then 15 years! It only seems to have gotten worse in recent months. Before, it was simply me using rehashed ideas and cliche story lines, but now... It's like I am completely drained of creative talent. Every time I sit down to write, I can not come up with <i>any ideas</i> for a story, theme or character to write about. And it's become rather worrisome for me.<br /> <br /> Has anybody else suffered this problem before and found a way to cure it? And if so, what are some tips you have for doing so?<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TwistedImage</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1128646-the-fanfiction-thread?p=1144570#post1144570\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My problem is that I have a ton started but few finished. My muse likes to jump around a bit much.</div> </div> </div> </div>Same here. I've canceled more stories than I've completed. They seem really exciting to me at first, but then I lose interest and move on to something else.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Flyboy254</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1128646-the-fanfiction-thread?p=1134549#post1134549\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Do you recommend Archive of Our Own over FF.net, or is FF still the place to go?</div> </div> </div> </div>Assuming FF is Fanfiction.net, I stopped using that a long time ago. Ever since they changed their website to a form that doesn't allow double spacing, every story on there comes across as being extremely cluttered and badly paced.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1394,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","user":"Nyrufa","date":". 11-15-2017, 10:21 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T08:28:16-08:00","id":1158957,"title":"","content":"I'm actually writing a bit of NWOD fanfiction myself, if anyone is interested in knowing/getting links. <a href=\"https://forums.sufficientvelocity.com/threads/white-wolfs-world-of-darkness.6205/\" target=\"_blank\">https://forums.sufficientvelocity.co...darkness.6205/</a><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8fsIR2T.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13566-kalzky","name":"Kalzky","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13566_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"61"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-19T02:43:20-08:00","id":1160460,"title":"","content":"I write some fanfic. Nothing extraordinary, no crossovers or alternate realities (not that's anything wrong with that, but I tried once and it just is not my stile), merely World Of Darkness fiction. And since I'm a fan, I guess that counts.<br /> <br /> I don't exactly get tons of attention for that but hey, practice is always good and I like what I do enough to feel satisfied when I finish a chapter.<br /> <br /> Edit: I realized that sharing a link here would not hurt. <a href=\"http://archiveofourown.org/users/SpectreOfCinders\" target=\"_blank\">Here I am. </a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/815620-cinder-s-comprehensive-collection-of-creations\" target=\"_blank\">Cinder's Comprehensive Collection of Creations</a> - Homebrew Hub<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1172470-cinder-writes-about-beast-the-primordial\" target=\"_blank\">I write about Beast: The Primordial a lot</a>","edited":{"userid":38,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder","user":"Cinder","date":". 11-19-2017, 07:06 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder","name":"Cinder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar38_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1408"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-26T16:07:37-08:00","id":1162820,"title":"","content":"Hey, is anyone here willing to beta read?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/483-flyboy254","name":"Flyboy254","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar483_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"703"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-26T17:01:49-08:00","id":1162828,"title":"","content":"So, here is my new and improved AO3 page, now under the new pen name of MartinMalory. I just posted the first chapter of a new fanfic about Dungeons &amp; Dragons, though so far I only have the framing chapter up.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://archiveofourown.org/users/MartinMalory\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://archiveofourown.org/users/MartinMalory\" target=\"_blank\"> Request temporarily denied. | Archive of Our Own </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://archiveofourown.org/users/MartinMalory\" target=\"_blank\"> http://archiveofourown.org/users/MartinMalory </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1579-camilla","name":"Camilla","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1579_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1044"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-27T23:40:54-08:00","id":1163179,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Resplendent Fire</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1128646-the-fanfiction-thread?p=1128704#post1128704\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I am more bothered by people who are aggressively anti-fanfiction than I am by anyone who has never read or written any.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Probably because the vast majority of fanfiction is nothing but A) Romance, B) Grimdark Edgelords, or C) both at once!<br /> <br /> The amount of fanfiction that tries to tell an actual story with an engaging plot is quite rare, from my experience.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-28T11:33:40-08:00","id":1163293,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyrufa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1128646-the-fanfiction-thread?p=1163179#post1163179\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The amount of fanfiction that tries to tell an actual story with an engaging plot is quite rare, from my experience.</div> </div> </div> </div>Look, I can only write so fast, give me some time here.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/483-flyboy254","name":"Flyboy254","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar483_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"703"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-29T15:56:09-08:00","id":1163740,"title":"","content":"I recently got back into posting on Fanfiction.net and my username is Willy The Hillbilly. I just posted the first chapter of an AU crossover fic of Naruto and Grand Theft Auto III titled &quot;Jacked&quot;. I intend to include Vampire: The Requiem and Changeling: The Lost in later chapters.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.fanfiction.net/s/12742297/1/Jacked\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.fanfiction.net/s/12742297/1/Jacked</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1579-camilla","name":"Camilla","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1579_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1044"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-29T19:10:24-08:00","id":1163797,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyrufa, emphasis mine</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1128646-the-fanfiction-thread?p=1163179#post1163179\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> <br /> Probably because the vast majority of fanfiction is nothing but <u><b>A) Romance</b></u>, B) Grimdark Edgelords, or C) both at once!<br /> <br /> The amount of fanfiction that tries to tell an actual story with an engaging plot is quite rare, from my experience.</div> </div> </div> </div>Why does that have to be framed as a negative? Like, Sturgeon's Law (or Revelation if you prefer) still applies, but that applies to all media. I get it if you're saying that Fan Fics can come off as being one-note due to the sheer number of shipping fics and that turns people off, but dismissing the entire romance genre just because its romance is kinda icky and one of my not-favourite parts of society.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-01T03:09:27-08:00","id":1164214,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Second Chances</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1128646-the-fanfiction-thread?p=1163797#post1163797\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Why does that have to be framed as a negative? Like, Sturgeon's Law (or Revelation if you prefer) still applies, but that applies to all media. I get it if you're saying that Fan Fics can come off as being one-note due to the sheer number of shipping fics and that turns people off, but dismissing the entire romance genre just because its romance is kinda icky and one of my not-favourite parts of society.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Ah, well I'll try to clarify as best I can. This is speaking from my own personal experience and covers roughly 90% of all fanfiction I've come across over the last 17 years of my life.That's rounding down, by the way.<br /> <br /> A villain can't just be a simple villain, he has to be a Chaos Marine that just fell out of a Warp storm, ready to brutally torture everybody around them because it's funny!<br /> <br /> <br /> Canon characters almost never stay IN character, instead behaving in a fashion that is completely against their established personas in order to fit in line with the writer's fan made plot.<br /> <br /> <br /> Shippings require little or no chemistry to have been established in the canon universe between two (or more) characters before the writer / artist decides to hook them up with each other. Their 'romance' appears to be based more on the creator's erotic fantasies, as opposed to whether or not the characters would actually fit together.<br /> <br /> <br /> If the fanfiction is an action story, there will inevitably be at least one character somewhere in the story who is blatantly over powered, or will receive an absurd increase in power in order to overcome some obstacle.<br /> <br /> <br /> I think that about covers all the basic tropes.<br /> <br /> I can't explain everybody's reason for viewing fanfiction in a negative light, but I can give my own personal interpretation. The anger towards it probably stems from being a fan of the source material. So when one (or in this case, I) comes across a story / comic / artwork / whatever that tries to give the setting a complete overhaul and then calls their creation a work of 'fandom,' it can be seen as insulting at best, and downright heresy at worst. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <br /> That being said, I still try to write fanfics once in a while, but I try to focus on original characters set within the same universe, instead of screwing with the canon ones.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-07T04:45:41-08:00","id":1165822,"title":"","content":"Not mine, but I founded this one really fun to read: <a href=\"http://archiveofourown.org/works/11924595\" target=\"_blank\">http://archiveofourown.org/works/11924595</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/822-daemonchrno","name":"DaemonChrno","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar822_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"118"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-07T08:24:06-08:00","id":1165878,"title":"","content":"Currently planning a crossover AU fic of Attack On Titan and Vampire: The Masquerade.<br /> <br /> Imagine Eren as a Kindred, now that would be awesome!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1579-camilla","name":"Camilla","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1579_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1044"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-01T16:23:09-08:00","id":1172415,"title":"","content":"Help me Fanfic Thread Kenobi, you're my only hope! <br /> <br /> Okay, I'm sure I'll come up with something eventully, but I'm not opposed to hive-minding. I'm outlining a Harry Potter fanfic where instead of wizards, everyone is a Werewolf from Werewolf: the Forsaken. I'm actually finding the translation of stories and themes works really well, but I'm stuck on one part. In HP&amp;PS, there was a lot of foreshadowing of wands being important and the physical, tangible parallel between Harry and Voldemort was made by their wands sharing the same core (also foreshadowing). Try as I might, I can't come up with something similar for Werewolves to take its place. I tried fetishes, but I can't seem to make it click. Any thoughts?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-01T16:49:05-08:00","id":1172430,"title":"","content":"Please feel free to post it when you're done, Second Chances, if you publish it at all. I've 