er. This time it was my WtF!HP I was working on (getting a better outline, but still slow progress) when my brain decided to figure out a way to make HP work with Planescape. And it works. Its decent. Line each of the Hogwarts houses up with one of the Paraelemental Planes thematically so that inter-house conflict is focused on opposing elements rather than the alignment spectrum (Gryffindor is Smoke, Hufflepuff is Magma, Ravenclaw is Ice, and Slytherin in Ooze). Then instead of Hogwarts being a school for witches and wizards, make it open to all spellcasters and magic users. It could work.<br /> <br /> But dammit, I need to write my Werewolf fanfics first!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":4433,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","user":"Second Chances","date":". 02-07-2018, 06:58 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-07T16:01:36-08:00","id":1183414,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Camilla</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1128646-the-fanfiction-thread?p=1172594#post1172594\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I've given up completely on AO3 and I am switching over to Fanfiction.Net as it has more users.<br /> <br /> My username there is Ninja Railroad!<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.fanfiction.net/u/3286123/\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.fanfiction.net/u/3286123/</a></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I've hated Fanfiction.net ever since they changed the site to no longer allow double spaces in stories. Makes everything come across as bunched together and difficult to read properly. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-07T23:04:29-08:00","id":1183486,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyrufa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1128646-the-fanfiction-thread?p=1183414#post1183414\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> I've hated Fanfiction.net ever since they changed the site to no longer allow double spaces in stories. Makes everything come across as bunched together and difficult to read properly. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I mainly use Fanfiction.net because it has a larger userbase and gets more views. I have three accounts there (Ninja Railroad, Doc Sammy, and KidVid712).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1579-camilla","name":"Camilla","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1579_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1044"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-03T22:58:43-08:00","id":1191546,"title":"","content":"I apologize for the double-post, but I am back in the fanfiction game and have returned to Archive Of Our Own with a new name and style.<br /> <br /> I just posted the first two chapters of a new fanfic story inspired by a mix of childhood nostalgia, fondness for Army Men and similar plastic toy soldiers, and my all-time favorite role-playing game, Big Eyes Small Mouth.<br /> <br /> Here it is, titled <b>War Toys: Operation Martin Hollow</b>.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://archiveofourown.org/works/13863942/chapters/31892457\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"http://archiveofourown.org/images/ao3_logos/logo_42.png\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://archiveofourown.org/works/13863942/chapters/31892457\" target=\"_blank\"> Home | Archive of Our Own </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://archiveofourown.org/works/13863942/chapters/31892457\" target=\"_blank\"> http://archiveofourown.org/works/13863942/chapters/31892457 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> An Archive of Our Own, a project of the Organization for Transformative Works </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Check it out and tell me what you think of it so far.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1579-camilla","name":"Camilla","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1579_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1044"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}